2026-07-28T16:57:23.7920393Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7963923Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7964607Z i /tmp/RtmpGzdhuv/duckdb
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7964989Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7965411Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7965772Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7966345Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7967138Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-28T16:57:23.7967760Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-28T16:57:23.8169391Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-28T16:57:23.8269321Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-28T16:57:23.8600908Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-28T16:57:23.8708500Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
